  <!-- Generic pawn-table tier (table-model T5, GenericPawnTableScope).
       CellNotReadable is the honest fallback for an unknown mod column's
       cell; Incapable mirrors the work tab's disabled-work meaning; Trained
       marks a completed animal training. HourRange/HourSingle format a
       timetable cell's contiguous segments: hour params are 0-23, the last
       param is the assignment label. PawnTableRegion names a pawn table
       whose main button carries no label. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Shell.Generic.CellNotReadable>değer mevcut değil</RimWorldAccess.Shell.Generic.CellNotReadable>
